    "detailed_description": "As a castaway you strand on a remote island. Sounds like a romantic adventure in perfect loneliness - but not in this game! After all, that island is literally the last resort of the fleeing masses. An insane survival training full of slapstick fun begins, full of rabid ex tofu lovers and lots of goofy slapstick fun! Whether it's engaging adventures, tricky <strong>puzzles</strong>, fun <strong>text adventures</strong> as side quests or even a <strong>Solitaire championship</strong> in the local tavern. The game is not a smartphone port, but a PC game!<br><br><strong>Achievement </strong>hunters can look forward to a big variety of rewards for <strong>creative </strong>and heroic deeds.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique gameplay mechanics</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/820910/extras/66f96cab0a906045ed81b80544cb3b2d.poster.avif?t=1725374151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/820910/extras/66f96cab0a906045ed81b80544cb3b2d.webm?t=1725374151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/820910/extras/66f96cab0a906045ed81b80544cb3b2d.mp4?t=1725374151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build your settlement!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/820910/extras/ad239dabb441dde73158d61bc4006526.poster.avif?t=1725374151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/820910/extras/ad239dabb441dde73158d61bc4006526.webm?t=1725374151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/820910/extras/ad239dabb441dde73158d61bc4006526.mp4?t=1725374151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vid